          "description": "- **\"Receive All\" is now instant.** This version adds an optional server mod that\ncollects the attachments from *all* your chats in a single request - no more\nlong waits with big mailboxes. The mod still works fine without it (it falls\nback automatically, and even that path got faster).\n\n- **Fixed:** with roughly 30+ chats, older\nversions could make the chat selection keep snapping back to one dialogue for\nup to a minute after opening the messenger. Updating the client plugin alone\nfixes this.",
